{"seq":2,"slug":"secularism","title":"世俗化","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/secularism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"separating-mosque-and-state","title":"政教分离","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/secularism/separating-mosque-and-state","wordCount":1601,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"abolishing-the-caliphate","title":"废除哈里发制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/secularism/abolishing-the-caliphate","wordCount":1915,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 世俗化\n\n世俗化，是凯末尔改革的核心与现代土耳其的立国原则。本章考察这一根本变革。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"政教分离\"——他把宗教从国家政治中剥离、确立世俗国家性质。第二篇文档讲述\"废除哈里发制\",呈现这一震撼伊斯兰世界、确立彻底世俗性的举措。\n"}